# Keep AI context focused: drop heavy/generated, low-signal, and sensitive files.
# repomix already honors .gitignore (node_modules etc.); these are the extras.

# Lockfiles — large, low signal for reasoning
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/yarn.lock

# Build / coverage output
dist/
build/
out/
coverage/

# repomix's own output
repomix-output.*

# Secrets / local env — never feed to a model (defense-in-depth)
.env
.env.*
